327 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We used VIF to detect multicollinearity between factors. Generally the VIF is under a value of 2 but when VIF exceeds 10, we remove that factor to ensure model stability. This happened specifically with Tucker_Factor_1 in Technology and ind_mom in Consumer sectors. If we kept these high-VIF factors, our model would produce unreliable results, as it wouldn't be able to distinguish the individual impact of each factor.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
